{"title":"*Equality of Permission*","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/957142229/0/marginalrevolution~Equality-of-Permission.html","date":1779606325000,"content":"<p>The subtitle is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Equality-Permission-Politics-Feasible-Liberalism/dp/0226852393/ref=sr_1_1?crid=32YAABNB8OCUX&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.z_MnooU2ghBQjmURR6btJrd90lewJzubT0GwJBAWb8U.jY_g1r-KD1pvBC_5Lo5RVxZvaGK_tFudyBoscacqauk&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=equality+of+permission&amp;qid=1779538143&amp;sprefix=equality+of+permission%2Caps%2C178&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Politics of Feasible Liberalism</a>, and the author is Deirdre Nansen McCloskey.  The author wishes to argue for liberalism <em>as opposed to statism</em>, a very good book.  And unlike many authors, Deirdre also tells you what she thinks of everyone else’s views.  Due out in November.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/equality-of-permission.html\">*Equality of Permission*</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/957142229/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/957142229/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/957142229/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/957142229/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/957142229/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://